{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17170","headline":"感寓 · 权德舆","name":"感寓","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"残雨倦欹枕，病中时序分。\n秋虫与秋叶，一夜隔窗闻。\n虚室对摇落，晤言无与羣。\n冥心试观化，世故如丝棼。\n但看鸢戾天，岂见山出云。\n下里徒撃节，朱弦秘南薰。\n梧桐秀朝阳，上有威凤文。\n终待九成奏，来仪瑞吾君。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17170.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17170","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}